WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Markdown preview cap

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:08.800
Before: entire actual desktop recording; local scrolling, Old/New, actual Diff and shorter Markdown content retain their behavior.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:16.200
After: entire actual desktop recording; local scrolling, Old/New, actual Diff and shorter Markdown content retain their behavior.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.400
Before: entire actual phone recording; long content scrolls and short content shrinks under the same 600 px cap.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.600
After: entire actual phone recording; long content scrolls and short content shrinks under the same 600 px cap.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.600
Before: matched full context in Light+; measured long preview height and max-height are 600 pixels.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.600
After: matched full context in Light+; measured long preview height and max-height are 600 pixels.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Before: actual long-preview detail in Light+; the 600-pixel maximum and local scrollbar are preserved.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.600
After: actual long-preview detail in Light+; the 600-pixel maximum and local scrollbar are preserved.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.600
Before: actual short-preview detail; measured content panel height is 185 pixels in both runs, below the 600-pixel cap.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.600
After: actual short-preview detail; measured content panel height is 185 pixels in both runs, below the 600-pixel cap.
